---
// ponytail: Contact section
---
<section id="contact" class="py-[clamp(4rem,8vw,8rem)] text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  <h2 class="text-[clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem)] font-bold mb-4 scroll-reveal opacity-0">Get In Touch</h2>
  <p class="text-text-muted mb-8 scroll-reveal opacity-0">Whether you have a question or just want to say hi, I'll try my best to get back to you!</p>
  <a href={`mailto:${import.meta.env.CONTACT_EMAIL || 'hello@example.com'}`} class="inline-block bg-[#111111] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-[4px] hover:scale-[0.98] active:scale-[0.98] transition-transform scroll-reveal opacity-0 font-medium">Say Hello</a>
</section>
